  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and pepper; cook, stirring frequently, for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder; cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add 1 cup of water; bring to a simmer, then cover and transfer to the oven.",
    "Bake for 2 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Stir in the chopped dill pickles and cilantro; cook over low heat until wilted.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the lamb hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
